78768-b2d7-49a4-8a60-96ff2c7253a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f799e394e9b020a7f683f25fd6f325be, https://si.imgix.net/ad106e10/uploads/origins/29778768-b2d7-49a4-8a60-96ff2c7253a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=191312166bfa7e6497d4a303b376a44b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ad106e10/uploads/origins/29778768-b2d7-49a4-8a60-96ff2c7253a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=af5e4ee02d7e208477a63cc57bdd4e8c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ad106e10/uploads/origins/29778768-b2d7-49a4-8a60-96ff2c7253a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=35df4ea2143f72db85d99658f9acdc98", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ad106e10/uploads/origins/29778768-b2d7-49a4-8a60-96ff2c7253a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=35df4ea2143f72db85d99658f9acdc98, https://si.imgix.net/ad106e10/uploads/origins/29778768-b2d7-49a4-8a60-96ff2c7253a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=72a803ed40d88101ae3ef356da2f55ef 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ad106e10/uploads/origins/29778768-b2d7-49a4-8a60-96ff2c7253a8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7683b7b8e712e7eba5418959ea21b4c5 3x"}, "body": "我想让你画贝阿朵丽切（Beatrice）。\n她的姿势我希望是张开双臂的，像这张图里的姿势：\nhttps://www.shutterstock.com/image-photo/young-woman-smiling-camera-arms-260nw-1800943528.jpg\n（手臂的比例显然不一样，我也不希望完全照着图画，那样会很糟糕，请只参考这个姿势）\n背景方面，我想要的是金色玫瑰和金色蝴蝶的背景，在夜空之下，就像这张图那样：\nhttps://c4.wallpaperflare.com/wallpaper/378/572/858/umineko-no-naku-koro-ni-glowing-beatrice-1250x1000-animals-butterflies-hd-art-wallpaper-preview.jpg\n另外，请把贝阿朵丽切画在和这张图里差不多的距离感上。\n还有，请像你之前说的那样，在背景里藏一些能代表角色的重要物品。\n这些物品要代表的是右代宫家所有的孩子（也就是所有的“儿女”）。\n老实说，我觉得这幅图最难画的部分就是背景。\n最后，我希望你像上次一样，用金色文字写上一句：人間の感情を理解できなければ、その真実を理解することはできない。", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@NEKObako/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2605209, "client_id": 3510861, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2cdf531e/uploads/origins/9be5b818-85c3-4fc9-b286-270d3956c911?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a55ef459124bf36642fe4c58c46fc77", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2cdf531e/uploads/origins/9be5b818-85c3-4fc9-b286-270d3956c911?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a55ef459124bf36642fe4c58c46fc77, https://si.imgix.net/2cdf531e/uploads/origins/9be5b818-85c3-4fc9-b286-270d3956c911?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f793c67342e02c0dde3a5249c765c0b1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2cdf531e/uploads/origins/9be5b818-85c3-4fc9-b286-270d3956c911?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fabb15d503ff0c7211a58ff44a7b9f84 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2cdf531e/uploads/origins/9be5b818-85c3-4fc9-b286-270d3956c911?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cc9e91480bb7dce109ed24fc67734851", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2cdf531e/uploads/origins/9be5b818-85c3-4fc9-b286-270d3956c911?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cc9e91480bb7dce109ed24fc67734851, https://si.imgix.net/2cdf531e/uploads/origins/9be5b818-85c3-4fc9-b286-270d3956c911?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=254e58e6b946594d703a6a59507d071c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2cdf531e/uploads/origins/9be5b818-85c3-4fc9-b286-270d3956c911?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=415ec8d3d1a39771e9a540998869bbfb 3x"}, "body": "你好我在 twitter 上关注你有一段时间了，所以当我知道你在接受请求时，我就知道我到底想请你画什么了！我是你的忠实粉丝，很希望能看到你画的六平チヒロ カグラバチ的插画，可以用作个人照片、横幅等等...\n\n我不知道您是否熟悉这个故事，但从本质上讲，他是一个悲剧英雄，失去了很多对他来说很重要的东西，并开始使用他父亲生前制作的魔法金鱼剑进行复仇。这听起来有点傻，但非常棒。我将在链接中留下一些参考资料，以便您能感受到这种氛围，但忧郁自暴自弃的那种表情，并强调他脸上有伤疤的一面将是完美的。\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/H14FuzLSrmsWZRoX6", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@NEKObako/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2605209, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e2c9e38f/uploads/origins/579da331-87fb-4de5-b01d-f9f220015124?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd7939dd42dd41721abffc77c5f0fb4b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e2c9e38f/uploads/origins/579da331-87fb-4de5-b01d-f9f220015124?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd7939dd42dd41721abffc77c5f0fb4b, https://si.imgix.net/e2c9e38f/uploads/origins/579da331-87fb-4de5-b01d-f9f220015124?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97a35b50693d9c004b22510600062725 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e2c9e38f/uploads/origins/579da331-87fb-4de5-b01d-f9f220015124?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1cb1a34d5683a006eeed3bd6bb2f41c1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e2c9e38f/uploads/origins/579da331-87fb-4de5-b01d-f9f220015124?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=25e420d8fd0779348ce7090dce23b367", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e2c9e38f/uploads/origins/579da331-87fb-4de5-b01d-f9f220015124?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=25e420d8fd0779348ce7090dce23b367, https://si.imgix.net/e2c9e38f/uploads/origins/579da331-87fb-4de5-b01d-f9f